{"seq":3,"slug":"fpga-development-flow","title":"FPGA 开发流程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-development-flow","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"synthesis-implementation","title":"综合与实现流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-development-flow/synthesis-implementation","wordCount":1776,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"constraint-files","title":"约束文件编写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-development-flow/constraint-files","wordCount":1430,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"simulation-timing-analysis","title":"仿真与时序分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-development-flow/simulation-timing-analysis","wordCount":1644,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"fpga-开发流程\">FPGA 开发流程</h1><p>本章详细介绍 FPGA 从 RTL 设计到最终比特流生成的完整工程流程。涵盖综合（Synthesis）与实现（Implementation）、约束文件（XDC/SDC）编写、以及仿真与时序分析三大核心环节，帮助学习者掌握工业级 FPGA 开发的标准实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>综合与实现流程</strong> — 从 RTL 到网表再到布局布线的完整流水线</li>\n<li><strong>约束文件编写</strong> — 时序约束、引脚约束与物理约束的规范化表达</li>\n<li><strong>仿真与时序分析</strong> — 功能仿真、时序仿真与静态时序分析方法论</li>\n</ol>\n"}